<title>PHILIPPINES: South China ventures into banking, water.</title>
<headline>South China ventures into banking, water.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil explorer South China Petroleum and Exploration Inc said on Tuesday it would invest in a local development bank and water supply projects.</p>
<p>The company told the Philippine Stock Exchange it would buy 1.25 million shares, or 24.5 percent, of Premiere Development Bank at their par value of 100 pesos each.</p>
<p>South China said it also planned to invest in unspecified water supply projects.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
